---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service – Usage Guidelines"
  description={`Terms and conditions governing the use of ${siteConfig.name}, including browser technical limitations and disclaimers.`}
  path="/terms/"
>
  <article class="content-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal & Operating Guidelines</p>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>

    <p>
      Last updated: September 2026. By accessing and using {siteConfig.name} (the "Service"),
      you agree to be bound by the following terms and conditions.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Nature of the Service</h2>
    <p>
      {siteConfig.name} provides free, client-side browser utilities, including a digital and analog clock,
      stopwatch with lap tracking, countdown timer, alarm clock, world clock, and time zone converter.
      All calculations and state management execute directly within your web browser.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Technical Limitations & Browser Sleep Notice</h2>
    <p>
      Because our instruments run in client-side web browser tabs without native operating system privileges:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Device Sleep & Screen Off:</strong> When your device enters system sleep, standby, or battery-saver
        mode, the browser engine may throttle or entirely pause JavaScript timers and audio execution.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Critical Reminders:</strong> For vital wakeups, flights, critical medical appointments, or urgent
        commitments, always set your device's native operating system alarm as a primary reminder.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Sound Playback:</strong> Modern web browsers enforce strict autoplay policies. Audio alarms require
        prior user interaction on the page to ensure audio privileges are granted.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Accuracy of Time and Time Zone Data</h2>
    <p>
      Local device times depend on your personal computer or smartphone's system clock. Time zone conversions
      rely on the standardized IANA Time Zone Database implemented in your browser's JavaScript engine.
      While we apply rigorous testing and DST validation, regional governments occasionally alter daylight saving
      rules without sufficient advance notice, which may temporarily affect conversion outputs.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      All visual design, code structure, written guides, and original 3D artistic assets of the Living Clock
      (including all scene textures and models) are the exclusive intellectual property of {siteConfig.name}.
      You may not scrape, republish, or commercialize these assets without explicit written permission.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Disclaimer of Warranties & Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      The Service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express
      or implied. In no event shall the operators of {siteConfig.name} be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental,
      or consequential damages arising out of the use or inability to use the instruments.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions regarding these Terms should be directed to our support team at
      <a href="mailto:contact@clockgarden.com">contact@clockgarden.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
